== Hero Ability ==

The Arcanist multiplies all sources' profits by:
<br><math>\left( S \times \frac{G}{80} + 1 \right) \times L^2 \times C + 1</math>
<br>where:
* <math>S = \text{Spells Cast this Exile}</math>
* <math>L = \text{Character Level}</math>
* <math>C = \text{Character Ability Power}</math>
* <math>G = \text{Character Ability Power Growth Rate}</math>


